WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.170
Actually, something revolutionary I did today

2
00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:07.830
was going to wake up a team that had gone quiet.

3
00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:13.240
But it also makes you realise, through the Consultant you can talk to:

4
00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:18.460
ok, the team has gone quiet, but sometimes it's actually us. Because, as we were saying before,

5
00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:21.900
I've had network marketing experience since 2013.

6
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:27.100
I know how to handle certain things in a certain way,

7
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:33.650
which someone who joined six months or a year ago may not have.

8
00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:38.530
And many times, before RelAI, I'd go and talk to these people

9
00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:46.250
bringing only my own experience, as if these people had it too,

10
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:49.430
as if they handled things the way I do. And that's not how it is.

11
00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:54.580
Thanks to RelAI I woke some people up,

12
00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:56.750
and one finally managed to tell me

13
00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:01.670
why she couldn't move forward in network marketing.

14
00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:06.090
She'd like to move forward, but she's stuck on «I don't know what to say»

15
00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:10.860
to the numbers in her contacts: «I'm scared of what they'll answer and I don't know how to handle it».

16
00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:13.880
And there we booked a call

17
00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:19.270
for Monday. The problem? I kept chasing both Salvatore and Gabriele:

18
00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:21.850
ok, I'm good through RelAI,

19
00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.130
but then live, what do I say to her?

20
00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:30.630
And the great thing is that, through the Consultant that's always there in RelAI,

21
00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:32.980
I was able to do an actual simulation.

22
00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:36.160
Today I spent two hours doing the simulation

23
00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:39.100
and it made me understand a lot of points

24
00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:42.900
where maybe we, unconsciously, advise

25
00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:47.860
a partner in our team something that actually tears them down.

26
00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:50.400
So it's truly a wonderful thing.

27
00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:55.160
It corrects you, it gives you so many things you'd never manage to see on your own.

28
00:01:55.210 --> 00:02:00.190
So even just for this I'd recommend it to anyone doing network marketing.
